      "seed": 1590532783,
      "version": 624,
      "versionNonce": 633940926,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1744361092000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "/auth\n  ├── POST   /auth/signup      → Register a new user\n  ├── POST   /auth/login       → Authenticate and get JWT\n  ├── GET    /auth/me          → Get logged-in user details\n  ├── POST   /auth/logout      → Logout user (invalidate token)\n\n/users\n  ├── GET    /users/profile             → Get a user's profile\n  ├── PATCH  /users/update        → Update user profile\n  ├── DELETE /users/delete          → Delete user account\n  ├── GET    /users/search              → Get all users (with filters/search)\n                           filters:  firstName, lastName\n  \n/friends\n  ├── POST   /friends/request  → Send a friend request\n  ├── POST   /friends/accept   → Accept a friend request\n  ├── DELETE /friends/remove   → Remove a friend\n  ├── GET    /friends/:id      → Get a user's friends list\n\n/posts\n  ├── POST   /posts            → Create a new post\n  ├── GET    /posts            → Get all posts (feed)\n  ├── ## GET    /posts/:id        → Get a single post\n  ├── ##  PATCH  /posts/:id        → Edit a post\n  ├── DELETE /posts/:id        → Delete a post\n  ├── POST   /posts/:id/like-unlike   → Like/unlike a post\n  |--- GET  /posts/image/:fileName -> returns the image.\n  ├── ## POST   /posts/:id/comment → Add a comment\n\n/events\n  ├── POST   /events           → Create an event\n  ├── GET    /events           → Get all events ## (sorted by trends)\n####  ├── GET    /events/:id       → Get details of a single event\n####  ├── PATCH  /events/:id       → Edit an event\n  ├── DELETE /events/:id       → Delete an event\n  ├── ## POST   /events/:id/register → Register for an event\n   |--- GET /events/search?hostId=hostedBy=   -> filter events by criteria\n\n## /chat\n  ├── ## POST   /chat             → Start a conversation\n  ├── ## GET    /chat/:id         → Get messages in a conversation\n  ├── ## POST   /chat/:id/send    → Send a message\n  ├── ## DELETE /chat/:id         → Delete a chat thread\n\n## /notifications\n  ├── ## GET    /notifications    → Get all notifications for a user\n  ├── ## PATCH  /notifications/:id → Mark a notification as read\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "/auth\n  ├── POST   /auth/signup      → Register a new user\n  ├── POST   /auth/login       → Authenticate and get JWT\n  ├── GET    /auth/me          → Get logged-in user details\n  ├── POST   /auth/logout      → Logout user (invalidate token)\n\n/users\n  ├── GET    /users/profile             → Get a user's profile\n  ├── PATCH  /users/update        → Update user profile\n  ├── DELETE /users/delete          → Delete user account\n  ├── GET    /users/search              → Get all users (with filters/search)\n                           filters:  firstName, lastName\n  \n/friends\n  ├── POST   /friends/request  → Send a friend request\n  ├── POST   /friends/accept   → Accept a friend request\n  ├── DELETE /friends/remove   → Remove a friend\n  ├── GET    /friends/:id      → Get a user's friends list\n\n/posts\n  ├── POST   /posts            → Create a new post\n  ├── GET    /posts            → Get all posts (feed)\n  ├── ## GET    /posts/:id        → Get a single post\n  ├── ##  PATCH  /posts/:id        → Edit a post\n  ├── DELETE /posts/:id        → Delete a post\n  ├── POST   /posts/:id/like-unlike   → Like/unlike a post\n  |--- GET  /posts/image/:fileName -> returns the image.\n  ├── ## POST   /posts/:id/comment → Add a comment\n\n/events\n  ├── POST   /events           → Create an event\n  ├── GET    /events           → Get all events ## (sorted by trends)\n####  ├── GET    /events/:id       → Get details of a single event\n####  ├── PATCH  /events/:id       → Edit an event\n  ├── DELETE /events/:id       → Delete an event\n  ├── ## POST   /events/:id/register → Register for an event\n   |--- GET /events/search?hostId=hostedBy=   -> filter events by criteria\n\n## /chat\n  ├── ## POST   /chat             → Start a conversation\n  ├── ## GET    /chat/:id         → Get messages in a conversation\n  ├── ## POST   /chat/:id/send    → Send a message\n  ├── ## DELETE /chat/:id         → Delete a chat thread\n\n## /notifications\n  ├── ## GET    /notifications    → Get all notifications for a user\n  ├── ## PATCH  /notifications/:id → Mark a notification as read\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
